.TH ZVM-COMPLETION 1 "August 2026" "ZVM" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zvm-completion \- generate shell completion scripts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zvm completion
.BR bash | zsh | fish | pwsh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a completion script for the selected shell to standard output.
The script is generated from the command tree of the running ZVM executable.
.SH SHELLS
.TP
.B bash
Generate Bash completion.
.TP
.B zsh
Generate Zsh completion.
.TP
.B fish
Generate fish completion.
.TP
.B pwsh
Generate PowerShell completion.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
source <(zvm completion bash)
zvm completion zsh > _zvm
zvm completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/zvm.fish
zvm completion pwsh > zvm.ps1
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zvm (1)
